// Signing.xcconfig — the ONLY place you need to edit to sign Flowbeat.
//
// When your Apple Developer account is approved:
//   1. Find your Team ID: developer.apple.com → Account → Membership details → Team ID
//      (10 characters, e.g. AB12CD34EF).
//   2. Put it after the "=" below, e.g.  DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = AB12CD34EF
//   3. Run `xcodegen generate` and open Flowbeat.xcodeproj. Automatic signing does the rest.
//
// project.yml applies this file to every target and configuration (Debug and Release).
// No target sets DEVELOPMENT_TEAM itself, so this value is never overridden.
// A Team ID is not a secret (it is printed inside every signed app), so committing it is fine.
//
// 签名只需要改这一行：账号批下来后，把 Team ID 填在等号后面，然后 `xcodegen generate`。

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
